          "text": "Kuko muri bgo ari ho ukugororoka kuva ku Mana guhishurwa, guheshwa n’ukwizera kukagwiza ukwizera, nk’uko vyanditswe, ng’ Umugororotsi azobeshwaho n’ukwizera.",
