            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuk’ ukuri kw’Imana bāgukāvye ibinyoma, bagasenga bagakorera icaremwe, bakakirutisha Iyakiremye, ni yo ikwiye gushimwa ibihe bidashira: Amen.",
